      "source": "FUNCTION solveNQueens(N):\n    board <- 2D array of size NxN initialized to 0\n    solutions <- EMPTY LIST\n\n    FUNCTION isSafe(board, row, col):\n        // Check column\n        FOR i FROM 0 TO row-1:\n            IF board[i][col] == 1:\n                RETURN False\n        // Check upper-left diagonal\n        i <- row - 1, j = col - 1\n        WHILE i >= 0 AND j >= 0:\n            IF board[i][j] == 1:\n                RETURN False\n            i <- i - 1, j = j - 1\n        // Check upper-right diagonal\n        i <- row - 1, j = col + 1\n        WHILE i >= 0 AND j < N:\n            IF board[i][j] == 1:\n                RETURN False\n            i <- i - 1, j = j + 1\n        RETURN True\n\n    FUNCTION placeQueen(board, row):\n        IF row == N:\n            APPEND copy of board TO solutions\n            RETURN\n        FOR col FROM 0 TO N-1:\n            IF isSafe(board, row, col):\n                board[row][col] = 1\n                placeQueen(board, row + 1)\n                board[row][col] = 0\n                // Backtrack\n\n    placeQueen(board, 0)\n    RETURN solutions",
